      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. Types of Protected Areas in India"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "India categorizes protected natural regions into distinct designations including National Parks and Wildlife Sanctuaries.",
        "Major Tiger Reserves serve as dedicated conservation zones under specialized government wildlife programs.",
        "Wildlife conservation programs aim to preserve biodiversity, endangered species, and balanced ecosystems.",
        "Understanding different types of protected areas is crucial for environmental management and competitive examinations."
      ],
      "id": "k62rqh7"
